    direction = { x: -1, y: 0 };
}
else if (event.key === "ArrowRight" && direction.x !== -1) {
    direction = { x: 1, y: 0 };
}
```

Your instinct is right: the opposite direction should be blocked. The main thing is to match the correct opposite value for each case.

