I’ll outline the cleanest way to add pause/resume for a snake game, including how to handle the spacebar and keep the timer logic safe.

Yes, that is a very good idea, and it is a nice polish feature for a project like this.

The clean way to do it is to separate the game state into:

- playing
- paused
- game over

Then the logic becomes much easier to control.

## Core idea

Add a variable:

```js
let isPaused = false;
```

Then in the game loop:

```js
const gameLoop = () => {
    if (isGameOver || isPaused) {
        return;
    }

    moveSnake();
    drawGame();
};
```

This prevents movement while paused.

## Spacebar behavior

Add a key listener:

```js
document.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
    if (event.key === " ") {
        event.preventDefault();

        if (isGameOver) {
            return;
        }

        if (isPaused) {
            isPaused = false;
            info.textContent = "";
        } else {
            isPaused = true;
            info.textContent = "Paused";
        }
    }
});
```

This means:

- pressing Space pauses the game
- pressing Space again resumes it

## Button version

If you also want a visible resume button, you can do it with:

```html
<button id="pauseBtn">Pause</button>
```

Then:

```js
pauseBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
    if (isGameOver) {
        return;
    }

    isPaused = !isPaused;

    if (isPaused) {
        info.textContent = "Paused";
        pauseBtn.textContent = "Resume";
    } else {
        info.textContent = "";
        pauseBtn.textContent = "Pause";
    }
});
```

## Important detail

You do not need to clear the interval when pausing. The simplest version is just to ignore the loop while `isPaused` is `true`.

This is better than clearing and restarting the interval because it keeps the logic simple and avoids timer stacking bugs.

## Recommended structure

Use these states:

- `isGameOver`
- `isPaused`

Then check them in:

- keyboard listener
- game loop
- reset function

That will make the game feel much more polished and robust.

If you want, I can next help you design the exact pause/resume button and keyboard logic step by step for your current code.

