}

.screen.active {
    display: block;
}
```

Then give the home screen `class="screen active"` initially and the game screen `class="screen"`. Also make sure the button variables are selected with `getElementById`.

When switching back home, stop or pause the game timer as well; changing which screen is visible does not stop JavaScript intervals.

