Your current `flex-wrap` layout won’t reliably center Save beneath Start. CSS Grid can guarantee that placement:

```css
.game-controls {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  grid-template-areas:
    "menu start mode"
