@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .game-controls {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    grid-template-areas:
      "menu"
      "start"
      "mode"
      "save";
  }
}
```

On smaller screens, the controls stack in the same order as their HTML, so keyboard focus order stays predictable.

